WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.540
This is my video. I was scrolling on Reels and this video popped up and I was like,

00:00:06.540 --> 00:00:10.700
this video looks familiar. The way this person is kicking looks familiar. And those are my pants.

00:00:10.820 --> 00:00:14.880
So I went back to my feed to make sure. And this is the video that they stole.

00:00:15.280 --> 00:00:19.220
They changed my face with an AI girl. This is not the first time this happened. This is another

00:00:19.220 --> 00:00:23.980
video that they stole. It has 500,000 views and it wasn't even posted on the same account. This

00:00:23.980 --> 00:00:27.980
is another account taking my videos. And it's super weird because all the comments think that

00:00:27.980 --> 00:00:31.660
it's real. I hope they crack down on this soon and AI detection gets better in the future.

00:00:31.860 --> 00:00:34.260
Otherwise, that might be it for social media and scrolling.
